SUMMARY:All About Florida! by Ruth Lampman
DESCRIPTION:Ruth Lampman taught high school art for over 30 years. Originally from New Jersey\, she spent many years working and doing her own artwork in Palm Beach County\, Florida. Her paintings in this collection are inspired by the years spent near the water where she took her own pictures of the places she visited and lingers. Each painting represents a personal view of her adventures\, with many inspired by depictions from her sketchbooks. Some of the locations are from places she lived in the past and some of the locations are still very much part of her life. Her primary medium is watercolor\, but she has also included pieces done in acrylic and oil paintings in this collection. \n\n \n\nToday\, she still teaches part time here in Tallahassee and enjoys spending outdoor fun with her family and friends.\n\n \n\nThis exhibit will be on display at the Leon County Main Library from October 30th\, 2026 through November 30\, 2026. \n\n \n\nInterested in having your own exhibit at one of the Leon County Library locations? See more information about the exhibit process and apply today at www.leoncountylibrary.org/showyourart\n
LOCATION:Leon County Main Library
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-15244-16967099
URL:https://leoncountyfl.libcal.com/event/16967099
END:VEVENT
